the whole VaynerMedia team,

00:01:42.051 --> 00:01:43.328
and I think they're all individual,

00:01:43.328 --> 00:01:45.124
but at my level, or what I do,

00:01:45.124 --> 00:01:47.740
not even probably, probably
not predicated in my level,

00:01:47.740 --> 00:01:49.644
just the way I roll when I think about

00:01:49.644 --> 00:01:51.989
the client stuff that I do, ya know,

00:01:51.989 --> 00:01:56.638
I would say 10% on text,

00:01:56.638 --> 00:01:58.788
40, actually I'm not gonna try to

00:01:58.788 --> 00:02:00.136
make this round out to 100.

00:02:00.136 --> 00:02:03.588
Let's see, it probably
is predominantly e-mail,

00:02:03.588 --> 00:02:07.453
solid amount face-to-face, I'm
a big face-to-face kinda fan,

00:02:07.453 --> 00:02:10.773
almost non-existent phone, and growing,

00:02:10.773 --> 00:02:13.885
'cause I'm pushing them, into more text,

00:02:13.885 --> 00:02:16.810
so face-to-face is probably 25%,

00:02:16.810 --> 00:02:17.971
the rest is digital.

00:02:17.971 --> 00:02:22.971
No Skype or Google Plus,
any of that kind of stuff.

00:02:23.009 --> 00:02:26.957
I'm just, I'm predominantly face-to-face,

00:02:26.957 --> 00:02:31.228
e-mail is number one,
face-to-face, texting,

00:02:31.228 --> 00:02:31.902
and that's that.

00:02:31.902 --> 00:02:35.103
No GoToMeeting, none of that stuff.

