00:08:10.482 --> 00:08:13.964
Keep this rolling by
the way, first of all.

00:08:13.964 --> 00:08:15.751
No editing here.

00:08:15.751 --> 00:08:17.216
No, no, I don't think you understand.

00:08:17.216 --> 00:08:19.676
